{
  "_source": [
    "PID Rulebook (Annex 3.01) document version 1.1, SD-JWT VC encoding, section 4.1, at",
    "eudi-doc-attestation-rulebooks-catalog commit 36f8adcf914ac06cac18d685add04e0a8a06d685.",
    "Every attribute and metadata item of sections 2.2-2.6 in its section 4.1 claim name and encoding,",
    "except `picture` (portrait): not yet mandatory (2.2, 24 months after the amending act), and",
    "AS-RP-03-01 (PID_03a) restricts its retention. Mandatory as CIR 2024/2977 makes them (2.2, 2.4),",
    "plus two this provider requires where the Rulebook does not: personal_administrative_number, left",
    "to each Member State (2.3), and place_of_birth.country, where 4.1 asks for 'at least one of",
    "country, region or locality'. Stricter than the Rulebook, never looser."
  ],
